                {
                  "phase": "grammar",
                  "type": "grammar_rule",
                  "content": {
                    "title": "Superlatives",
                    "explanation": "El superlativo dice que algo es el más… de un grupo: The Nile is the longest river in the world.\n\nAdjetivos cortos: the + -est (long → the longest, big → the biggest, funny → the funniest). Adjetivos largos: the most + adjetivo (the most beautiful, the most popular).\n\nIrregulares: good → the best, bad → the worst, far → the furthest.\n\nDetrás del superlativo solemos usar in con lugares y grupos (the biggest city in Ireland) y of con periodos (the best night of the year).",
                    "table": {
                      "headers": [
                        "Adjetivo",
                        "Comparativo",
                        "Superlativo"
                      ],
                      "rows": [
                        [
                          "long",
                          "longer",
                          "the longest"
                        ],
                        [
                          "big",
                          "bigger",
                          "the biggest"
                        ],
                        [
                          "funny",
                          "funnier",
                          "the funniest"
                        ],
                        [
                          "popular",
                          "more popular",
                          "the most popular"
                        ],
                        [
                          "good",
                          "better",
                          "the best"
                        ],
                        [
                          "bad",
                          "worse",
                          "the worst"
                        ]
                      ]
                    },
                    "examples": [
                      "The Nile is the longest river in the world.",
                      "Dublin is the biggest city in Ireland.",
                      "Galway is the most beautiful place in the world!",
                      "This is the best night of the year!"
                    ]
                  }
